BT /F1 10 Tf 54.00 513.00 Td (Using separate rails allows each subsystem to receive the voltage it needs. It also) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54.00 499.00 Td (improves control over noise, sequencing, power consumption, and debugging.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54.00 476.00 Td (In this project:) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 72.00 453.00 Td (- 1.2 V represents a core rail.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 72.00 436.00 Td (- 1.8 V represents an I/O rail.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 72.00 419.00 Td (- 3.3 V represents a peripheral/sensor rail.) Tj ET
